  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "b44f637e-5936-253c-6809-d3635715f21a",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "18b5877c-1699-40f5-34d5-afc93e4b8533",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "As a panel member, Dr. Javaid Khan, Associate Professor and Consultant Chest Physician in AKU's Department of Medicine, will be responsible for planning activities for the control of Tuberculosis in the world during his four-year tenure in this position. He will also provide technical advice to WHO on the control of Tuberculosis in the region.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Dr. Javaid Khan has been working with AKU for the last ten years, where he took the initiative of making AKU smoke-free, and continues to be the driving force in AKU's anti-smoking campaign.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
